{"c":[{"name":"20261004T181245Z-2154a79bf4058057","text":"W2: headless Chrome for Testing registers with LaunchServices, so caret-screen --only-pids <pid> reads it; accept.ts uses that for the AXManualAccessibility log check (Electron fixture via helper/scripts/electron-setup.sh).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T181245Z-2950b78a7b855fe8","text":"W1: an open connectNative port kept the MV3 worker alive through 360 s idle (same instance, CfT 154). Page acceptance: node fixtures/web-form/accept.ts; under a held heavy lock set CARET_HEAVY_LOCK_HELD=1 or its bridge build deadlocks.","type":"note"}]}
